/*!
\page page_sthltvpdhit StHltVpdHit

\brief HLT Vertex Position Detector (VPD) hit with timing and channel information for online vertex-z reconstruction.

\section overview Overview

`StHltVpdHit` stores timing and channel information for a single VPD hit recorded by the HLT.
The VPD has two assemblies at z ≈ ±5.6 m (east/west), each with 19 PMT channels. The east–west
time difference gives the online vertex z; the average gives the event start time t₀ stored in
\ref StHltEvent. Raw TDC values are slewing-corrected using the time-over-threshold (TOT).

\section hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StHltVpdHit
\endcode

\section datamembers Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `StBeamDirection` | `mDirection` | VPD side: east (0) or west (1) |
| `short` | `mChannel` | Channel index (0–18) |
| `float` | `mTdc` | Raw TDC time (ns) |
| `float` | `mTot` | Time-over-threshold (ns) |
| `float` | `mTof` | Calibrated time (ns) |
| `float` | `mTriggerTime` | Trigger reference time (ns) |

\section keymethods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `StBeamDirection direction() const` | East or west side |
| `short channel() const` | Channel index (0–18) |
| `int module() const` | Module index (channel/6) |
| `int cell() const` | Cell index (channel%6) |
| `float tdc() const` | Raw TDC (ns) |
| `float tot() const` | Time-over-threshold (ns) |
| `float tof() const` | Calibrated time (ns) |
| `float triggerTime() const` | Trigger reference time (ns) |

\section example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StSPtrVecHltVpdHit& vpdHits = hlt->vpdHit();
for (size_t i = 0; i < vpdHits.size(); ++i)
    cout << (vpdHits[i]->direction()==east ? "E" : "W")
         << " tof=" << vpdHits[i]->tof() << " ns" << endl;
\endcode

\see StHltEvent
\see StHltBTofHit
*/
